WEBVTT

00:00.960 --> 00:11.640
This sky is too brilliant, a new dawn has arrived.

00:17.980 --> 00:24.460
Even if I brandish what little courage I have,

00:24.560 --> 00:31.560
I won't understand the true meaning of strength.

00:32.390 --> 00:39.760
Let's climb up the gentle hill and become a star.

00:39.930 --> 00:43.070
If my wish comes true...

00:43.070 --> 00:49.820
My pain, my love, open up the door ahead...

00:49.820 --> 00:56.540
Just one drop of tears, faster than that one drop.

00:56.540 --> 01:06.050
I want to embrace you, therefore I will overcome my doubts in no time.

01:06.360 --> 01:13.080
This sky is too brilliant, the darkness will soon be gone.

01:13.370 --> 01:23.760
As the radiance hits the Prism, a new dawn has arrived.

01:45.790 --> 01:48.250
<i>I'm hungry...</i>

02:02.260 --> 02:05.580
Wandering Knights

02:08.320 --> 02:11.520
The new students of the Rosenberg Knights' Acadamy...

02:11.520 --> 02:15.070
had participated in their first battle at the Fortress of Grenzer.

02:16.820 --> 02:20.310
Due to an Angel's ambush and indiscriminate attack...

02:20.310 --> 02:24.580
both forces had suffered greatly. Suffered greatly.

02:29.200 --> 02:32.940
And the worst part wasn't the defeat...

02:36.270 --> 02:42.470
It was the scars left behind in the hearts of those who had participated in the battle. Scars.

02:42.720 --> 02:44.470
I humbly apologize.

02:46.130 --> 02:51.020
During this combat practice, most of the students were injured.

02:51.020 --> 02:56.990
It is my fault for not noticing the presence of an Angel...

02:57.310 --> 02:59.500
I'm willing to accept any punishment.

03:01.310 --> 03:02.420
Karin.

03:03.120 --> 03:07.500
Did Hyaweh really defeat the Angel?

03:08.200 --> 03:09.500
Yes.

03:10.010 --> 03:11.240
Is that so?

03:14.390 --> 03:17.760
Hyaweh and that sword, Ala-Gladius,

03:17.760 --> 03:20.510
are the key to our future battles.

03:21.550 --> 03:24.260
Keep your eye on him.

03:24.400 --> 03:26.510
What... What is the meaning of this?

03:31.310 --> 03:37.180
Just as I suspected, there is no doubt that Hyaweh is the heir to the throne. No doubt.

03:49.680 --> 03:54.680
Karin, you shouldn't blame yourself for this.

03:54.680 --> 03:59.670
I know. But just how long is he going to sleep?

03:59.960 --> 04:01.990
Just by missing one day of training,

04:01.990 --> 04:05.930
do you know how much your stamina will drop?

04:06.520 --> 04:08.380
And if it continues like this,

04:08.380 --> 04:12.230
not only training, but he won't be able to study either.

04:17.380 --> 04:20.510
Hyaweh is in trouble.

04:20.510 --> 04:22.240
Yeah, it's hopeless.

04:23.640 --> 04:26.950
If this goes on, it could risk his life as a knight.

04:28.790 --> 04:29.950
Life...

04:42.140 --> 04:45.100
Lady Priecia?

04:57.930 --> 05:00.280
Yo miss... What's the matter?

05:00.280 --> 05:03.140
Alone in a place like this at this time.

05:03.140 --> 05:05.280
How about some fun with us?

05:10.160 --> 05:14.880
Welcome! Welcome! There is a big service now!

05:14.880 --> 05:16.250
Are you listening?

05:17.210 --> 05:19.460
Come on, say something will you...

05:20.470 --> 05:23.630
Not good. A chance with the princess...

05:23.630 --> 05:25.300
I mean pinch.

05:27.300 --> 05:30.830
Come on. Start walking!

05:30.830 --> 05:33.710
Hold on! Get your hands off the lady!

05:34.070 --> 05:35.390
Who the hell are you?

05:41.540 --> 05:44.320
I don't need to give my name to the likes of you.

05:45.090 --> 05:48.110
This is bad. He's not an ordinary person.

05:48.350 --> 05:50.460
It's too late to realize that now!

05:50.460 --> 05:54.540
I'm moving in!  Go Acty Sword!

05:54.660 --> 05:59.350
Burning Tornado Psychic Max Symbol Titanic Flaming Hymn Freestyle Explosion Technique!

06:04.440 --> 06:06.940
I'm sorry... Priecia...

06:07.710 --> 06:09.290
What just happened?

06:09.290 --> 06:11.680
He really isn't an ordinary person.

06:15.270 --> 06:18.860
Don't get arrogant just because
you're a student at that knight school.

06:19.720 --> 06:21.880
Thanks to those knights,

06:21.880 --> 06:24.450
Windland is a goner.

06:30.630 --> 06:31.740
Stop.

06:40.160 --> 06:41.930
Who the hell are you?

06:41.930 --> 06:44.920
Would you like to join us as well?

06:45.300 --> 06:49.360
Even in those ratty clothes, you still look quite good.

06:57.600 --> 06:59.140
You bitch!

07:52.870 --> 07:54.950
You're the one who helped me out?

07:55.330 --> 07:56.490
Thanks.

08:00.040 --> 08:01.630
Are you listening?

08:01.630 --> 08:03.400
You could at least reply.

08:04.130 --> 08:05.380
You better stop there.

08:06.190 --> 08:07.640
You'll trample the seedlings.

08:08.090 --> 08:10.860
You saved me last night, right?

08:10.860 --> 08:13.410
I just wanted to thank you.

08:13.410 --> 08:14.180
Excuse me, then.

08:15.110 --> 08:16.010
Please wait.

08:17.090 --> 08:18.860
What is it now?

08:18.860 --> 08:22.740
I've just watered the plants, watch where you step.

08:24.110 --> 08:27.020
It won't be good if you injure the seedlings.

08:29.040 --> 08:33.030
What's with you! You are very annoying!

08:38.540 --> 08:40.840
This is your fault.

08:41.350 --> 08:43.540
It's because of your attitude.

08:44.830 --> 08:46.040
Is that so?

08:46.810 --> 08:50.360
Why don't you ask me who I am or what I was doing there?

08:50.840 --> 08:52.280
Not interested.

08:52.520 --> 08:55.050
What's your name?

08:55.050 --> 08:58.100
How about giving your own name first before asking for others?

08:58.860 --> 09:03.040
Oh really? Then it isn't necessary for me to know.

09:06.910 --> 09:08.080
Here.

09:16.410 --> 09:18.580
This... What am I supposed to do with this?

09:34.170 --> 09:35.090
It's delicious.

09:42.060 --> 09:43.600
She's not here.

09:43.920 --> 09:46.250
Not here, either. Not here.

09:46.700 --> 09:50.580
We've searched the entire school but...

09:50.580 --> 09:53.610
We've even searched the restrooms.

09:53.850 --> 09:58.140
Maybe Priecia isn't in the school...

09:59.450 --> 10:02.120
No. We can't be sure...

10:04.650 --> 10:08.950
Yeah... It might be due to the lack of love for Lady Priecia.

10:08.950 --> 10:12.690
I'll search the toilet stalls again.

10:16.220 --> 10:18.840
Everyone is so kind.

10:20.490 --> 10:23.350
It's our duty as her bodyguards.

10:32.980 --> 10:34.900
What are you doing?

10:35.190 --> 10:38.660
I'm doing some work to repay you for helping me.

10:51.540 --> 10:52.420
Did you find her?

10:52.710 --> 10:55.310
Everyone is outside looking for her now.

10:56.880 --> 10:59.940
Isn't this super-ultra bad?

10:59.940 --> 11:02.430
Yeah... It might be.

11:02.800 --> 11:04.470
I should go as well.

11:04.670 --> 11:06.430
You can't, Fel.

11:06.430 --> 11:08.260
You haven't fully recovered yet.

11:08.260 --> 11:10.380
I can't stay here doing nothing.

11:10.380 --> 11:13.190
I've finally become friends with Priecia...

11:17.190 --> 11:20.990
I don't want to lose anymore friends.

11:23.090 --> 11:24.420
Fel...

11:43.580 --> 11:44.590
Why?!

11:44.590 --> 11:46.690
Even after I've devotedly taken care of you...

11:46.690 --> 11:49.310
Why won't you turn red?!

11:49.310 --> 11:51.020
There are too many leaves.

11:52.110 --> 11:54.370
It's because you didn't remove the excess leaves.

11:54.370 --> 11:57.070
The nutrients are not able to reach the fruit.

11:57.260 --> 12:00.430
And if you take care of it too much everyday,

12:00.430 --> 12:02.820
it will cause the roots to become weak and rot.

12:03.000 --> 12:05.760
Are you trying to say that what I did was unnecessary?!

12:05.760 --> 12:07.080
Not really...

12:07.720 --> 12:13.520
Tomatoes have the ability to grow healthy on their own.

12:13.990 --> 12:17.130
It's just a vegetable. Don't they need me to take care off them!?

12:17.300 --> 12:19.810
It's not that they don't need it completely.

12:20.060 --> 12:22.220
Tomatoes and humans are very similar.

12:22.810 --> 12:28.140
They only require sufficient fertilizer, water and sunlight.

12:28.820 --> 12:32.790
But if someone gives it too much water,
the roots will start to rot.

12:32.790 --> 12:36.150
If there is too much fertilizer,
it will grow a lot of unnecessary leaves.

12:36.700 --> 12:40.360
Tomatoes only require the right amount of care.

12:42.550 --> 12:47.160
People, like you, who believe in
great strength and always rely on it,

12:47.960 --> 12:51.720
will never realize the true strength of the tomato.

12:54.760 --> 12:55.420
That's enough.

12:56.010 --> 12:58.840
Are there any vegetables that need taking care of?

12:58.840 --> 13:02.630
Why are you in a rush to grow vegetables?

13:04.140 --> 13:05.250
You...

13:06.060 --> 13:09.820
No... I was just interested in your tomatoes.

13:09.820 --> 13:13.270
Interested... in my tomatoes?

13:13.270 --> 13:15.440
What about the tomatoes interests you?

13:16.200 --> 13:16.690
The taste?

13:17.430 --> 13:18.190
The steps to plant it?

13:19.120 --> 13:20.190
Or the purpose to grow it?

13:21.580 --> 13:23.160
None of those, right?

13:23.160 --> 13:26.490
What you are interested in is... yourself.

13:28.160 --> 13:30.770
You don't really intend to plant vegetables.

13:30.770 --> 13:35.500
You are trying to escape from reality by concentrating on planting vegetables.

13:36.040 --> 13:38.380
This is only self-satisfactory.

13:38.990 --> 13:44.650
When planting the tomatoes, you have to be absorbed in it to grow delicious tomatoes.

13:44.650 --> 13:49.510
One who doesn't love vegetables has no right planting them.

13:50.650 --> 13:53.520
<i>...why do you want to be a knight?</i>

13:53.670 --> 13:56.330
<i>Protect? What do you want to protect?</i>

13:56.330 --> 13:59.520
<i>What you're trying to protect is that meager pride of yours.</i>

14:00.400 --> 14:02.890
<i>Pride is just a self-satisfaction.</i>

14:03.380 --> 14:06.530
<i>Those who are unable to let go of themselves have no right to wield a sword.</i>

14:11.790 --> 14:12.810
It's not that.

14:13.470 --> 14:14.210
Wait!

14:14.830 --> 14:19.690
Ever since I was born, everything I've
done has been for the country.

14:19.690 --> 14:24.730
Not once, have I ever done something for myself.

14:24.730 --> 14:28.820
And you call it self-satisfaction?

14:29.000 --> 14:29.650
Wait!

14:29.650 --> 14:32.140
Did you hear me?! Listen!

14:32.140 --> 14:33.880
Self-satisfaction is...

14:35.940 --> 14:38.790
That's not how it is...

14:40.660 --> 14:46.820
Then what have I been living for?

14:55.790 --> 14:56.830
How is it?

14:57.060 --> 15:03.670
It's no use. Lady Priecia is too far away.

15:03.670 --> 15:10.070
It looks like Priecia might have
gone outside the Rosenberg area.

15:10.070 --> 15:14.650
Outside the area? It's too vast for us to search...

15:14.650 --> 15:16.850
But we have to find her.

15:17.460 --> 15:19.040
How are we going to do that?

15:35.870 --> 15:36.870
Sorry about that.

15:38.420 --> 15:41.370
Wait up. Where are you going?

15:42.730 --> 15:45.420
It has nothing to do with you.

15:45.620 --> 15:49.940
If it has nothing to do with me,
then following you won't be a problem.

15:51.420 --> 15:53.090
Do as you please.

16:06.810 --> 16:08.530
Ah. It's Theresa-oneechan.

16:10.790 --> 16:12.550
Hey! Theresa!

16:12.890 --> 16:14.320
Theresa-oneechan...

16:16.770 --> 16:18.800
Weru, it's been a while.

16:18.800 --> 16:20.100
Are you doing well?

16:20.130 --> 16:22.090
Woah! Are these tomatoes?

16:22.090 --> 16:24.240
Amazing! There's a lot!

16:24.240 --> 16:25.200
It's a present.

16:25.200 --> 16:27.070
Share among yourselves.

16:27.070 --> 16:28.510
Okay!

16:33.050 --> 16:35.060
Wow! It's yummy!

16:35.060 --> 16:39.270
Stupid. These are Theresa's vegetables,
of course they're delicious.

16:39.310 --> 16:40.890
It's sweet.

16:41.120 --> 16:43.080
Really? That's good.

16:43.080 --> 16:44.180
Theresa...

16:44.940 --> 16:46.400
Who's that person?

16:46.770 --> 16:49.440
That person... My name is Priecia.

16:49.830 --> 16:52.790
Brat over there, don't open your mouth again.

16:53.060 --> 16:54.570
So she's Priecia...

16:54.570 --> 16:57.320
She talks funny.

16:57.320 --> 16:59.870
Priecia-oneesan, let's play together.

17:00.520 --> 17:01.450
Me?

17:01.570 --> 17:03.870
Yeah. Let's play knights.

17:04.130 --> 17:07.960
Knights? You may be small, but you're pretty smart.

17:08.270 --> 17:09.960
Onee-chan will be the monster.

17:10.860 --> 17:11.970
Monster...

17:12.330 --> 17:15.290
All right! Let's destroy the monster.

17:15.290 --> 17:17.420
Ah! Hey! What are you doing?

17:17.420 --> 17:19.550
Stop it.

17:19.550 --> 17:21.690
Stop it, both of you.

17:21.690 --> 17:22.750
Why, Weru?

17:22.750 --> 17:24.620
Are you the monster's companion?

17:24.620 --> 17:29.190
She's not a monster. Priecia-oneechan is Weru's little sister.

17:29.310 --> 17:30.230
What?!

17:30.560 --> 17:33.620
Playing house again? That's boring.

17:33.620 --> 17:37.990
That's not true. Theresa-oneechan will be the mother.

17:38.480 --> 17:40.240
I'll... be the mother?

17:40.450 --> 17:44.570
Priecia and Onee-chan, let's play together.

17:44.570 --> 17:45.940
Let go of me.

17:45.940 --> 17:49.540
Why do I have to play with you all?

17:50.020 --> 17:52.310
That's cute. Such a good child.

17:53.080 --> 17:55.340
Take this! Take this!

17:56.050 --> 17:58.170
Eat this!

17:58.170 --> 17:59.540
You won't hit me!

18:00.520 --> 18:03.170
You're going back already?

18:03.170 --> 18:04.210
Yeah.

18:04.210 --> 18:06.220
I'll bring more vegetables next time.

18:06.220 --> 18:08.700
Priecia should bring something too.

18:08.700 --> 18:10.480
If I feel like it.

18:10.480 --> 18:12.290
Let's play together again.

18:12.290 --> 18:13.820
All right. See you.

18:13.820 --> 18:14.820
Onee-chan.

18:17.540 --> 18:19.890
Thank you very much.

18:19.890 --> 18:25.120
I made a present for you.

18:26.850 --> 18:27.990
What is it?

18:30.050 --> 18:31.670
I would like you to wear it.

18:42.780 --> 18:44.830
What are you thinking?

18:44.830 --> 18:48.310
Even though it's a small present,  it contains their feelings.

18:48.310 --> 18:49.480
Accept it.

18:49.700 --> 18:51.980
I'm sorry. I can't.

18:55.370 --> 18:55.990
Hey!

18:57.580 --> 18:59.300
Weru, don't cry.

19:02.560 --> 19:06.500
I'll give this to Theresa, so don't cry.

19:08.840 --> 19:11.500
I'll definitely give it to her. I promise.

19:30.410 --> 19:33.980
So, your name is Theresa?

19:34.530 --> 19:36.250
Weru was crying.

19:37.930 --> 19:42.030
You planted those tomatoes to make them happy, right?

19:42.380 --> 19:44.720
What you said yesterday was right.

19:44.720 --> 19:49.040
I don't have a reason like you, which might be why they rotted.

19:49.620 --> 19:51.340
The sword is the same.

19:51.340 --> 19:55.940
Sword skills will not improve if you
don't know why you are wielding it.

19:59.370 --> 20:01.280
Why won't you accept it?

20:01.280 --> 20:05.050
She must have made it with the
same feelings you have for them.

20:06.100 --> 20:08.030
Leave me alone.

20:08.030 --> 20:12.250
You have your own sins to atone for, that's why you are here.

20:12.250 --> 20:15.480
You should be able to understand my feelings as well.

20:15.580 --> 20:19.190
Is it those sins that make you unable to wear this cross?

20:19.190 --> 20:24.570
Just because you are trapped in your past, doesn't mean you have to make her cry.

20:25.670 --> 20:28.100
I don't need the cross.

20:29.040 --> 20:33.080
The sins engraved on my soul will never be absolved.

20:33.680 --> 20:37.120
Because of those sins, I will be going to hell.

20:37.740 --> 20:43.090
Even after death, I will continue to repent for those sins.

20:44.030 --> 20:47.010
It's your decision if you want to repent,

20:47.010 --> 20:52.170
but I will stay here until you accept this cross.

20:52.170 --> 20:53.750
Don't do such meaningless things.

20:54.310 --> 20:55.100
It bothers me.

20:55.360 --> 20:58.620
Then ignore me, like you always do.

20:58.620 --> 21:00.900
I'll do as I please.

21:13.460 --> 21:16.080
Have you found Priecia?

21:21.910 --> 21:23.130
Aren't you...

21:25.860 --> 21:29.140
It's been a while, Kizarov.

21:42.270 --> 21:43.990
Prie...cia...

21:56.000 --> 22:02.230
When the star has fallen and the day becomes night,

22:02.610 --> 22:09.050
will the noise that I heard until yesterday disappear, too?

22:09.050 --> 22:15.840
In this brief moment of gentle wind, the sunlight shining through the trees

22:15.840 --> 22:22.530
gives me warmth in this dull scenery,

22:22.770 --> 22:29.620
so that I will still go on and reach that feeling!

22:30.120 --> 22:37.620
Even if I'm crying, even if I'm painfully wandering.

22:37.620 --> 22:43.550
I believe in your only radiance over there.

22:43.550 --> 22:50.820
Like the mists that shrouded the raining Earth,

22:51.130 --> 22:57.600
if all the meeting can be repeated on this planet,

22:57.850 --> 23:05.050
within this strange power, it will change into a miracle.

23:14.950 --> 23:17.910
Next Episode

23:16.490 --> 23:22.560
I would like to plant vegetables, watch the children smile and live a peaceful life.

23:22.560 --> 23:24.510
But because of that girl who came,

23:24.510 --> 23:27.370
my life and garden are ruined.

23:27.370 --> 23:29.870
Is this another punishment?

23:29.870 --> 23:32.810
Next episode, The Knights Meet Again.

23:32.810 --> 23:35.370
Shine, the prism of heart!

23:34.390 --> 23:39.000
The Knights Meet Again

23:35.370 --> 23:37.900
Meet again? Will someone be coming?
